      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, here's a draft based on your notes:\n\n---\n\n**Annual Review: Jordan**\n\nJordan has shown immense expertise and contributed significantly to our technical domain over the past year. Notably, Jordan's technical proficiency was crucial in the successful refactoring of our legacy API. However, this review aims to candidly address areas requiring improvement to support Jordan's continued professional growth.\n\nIn the more recent quarters, Jordan has faced challenges meeting major sprint deadlines. This has impacted our team's overall progress and pushed our schedule. Additionally, the observed increase in bugs in production suggests a need for closer adherence to our quality standards.\n\nCommunication within our team, particularly with junior developers, has not met our collaborative standards. Constructive and inclusive communication is essential for fostering a supportive and efficient work environment. We will want to work on this aspect of Jordan's leadership to enhance team cohesion.\n\nWhile we identify these areas of development, I would like to stress Jordan’s exceptional deep technical background and commitment. These core strengths can be pivotal in overcoming the highlighted challenges. I believe, with the right support and adjustments, Jordan will continue to excel and contribute significantly.\n\n---\n\nI hope this review maintains the balance of constructive feedback and appreciation for Jordan's strengths. Let me know if you want to make any",
